; bfsodium KECCAK THETA : the theta step of Keccak_f{1600}  FIPS 202 section 3
;
; HAND WRITTEN; The first of the five steps of a Keccak round and the only one
; that mixes the columns; Every lane of the state takes the exclusive or of two
; whole columns  one to its left and one to its right turned by a single bit;
;
; INTERFACE entry=200 exit=0 footprint=0:355
; IO  in:  A{200}  twenty five 64 bit lanes  each little endian
;     out: A{200}  the same  with theta applied
;
; TAPE MAP  (home @0)
;   @0x000:0x0c7  A{200}   the state; lane k is at cell 8k  and lane k is the
;                          lane FIPS 202 calls A{x  y} where k is 5y plus x
;   @0x0c8:0x0ef  C{40}    five lanes; C{x} is the exclusive or of column x
;   @0x0f0:0x117  D{40}    five lanes; D{x} is what column x contributes
;   @0x118:0x11f  T{8}     hands a lane back after it has been copied
;   @0x120:0x145  the exclusive or frame; xor64 footprint 0:37 pasted at @0x120
;                          so its x is @0x120  its y is @0x128 and its r @0x130
;   @0x148:0x163  the rotation frame; rotl64 footprint 0:27 pasted at @0x148
;                          so its w is @0x148 and its n is @0x150
;
; THE STEP  in FIPS 202's own letters:
;
;   C{x} = A{x 0} xor A{x 1} xor A{x 2} xor A{x 3} xor A{x 4}
;   D{x} = C{x minus 1} xor rotl(C{x plus 1}  1)
;   A{x y} = A{x y} xor D{x}
;
; with both of the index arithmetics taken modulo five; A column is the five
; lanes 5y plus x for y nought to four  so a column is a STRIDE of five lanes
; or forty cells  and that stride is the only reason this step needs a frame at
; all: xor64 wants its two operands eight cells apart and no two lanes of a
; column ever are;
;
; WHY THE OPERANDS ARE CARRIED TO A FRAME rather than the frame pasted at the
; operands  which is what poly1305/mulmod136 was relaid to do: idiom/xor64
; CONSUMES both of its operands and writes its answer to a third place eight
; cells further on; So a paste over two lanes would destroy both and land its
; answer on a third lane; A lane that is still needed is copied  through T  and
; a lane that is finished is moved;
;
; THAT CARRYING IS THE COST OF THIS FILE and it is not yet measured; The lesson
; HANDOFF records twice is to build it right and then profile it  so the
; distances here are simply the shortest the map allows  with the frames placed
; immediately above the state rather than beyond D;
;
; A COPY THROUGH T IS TWO RUNS  the first taking the lane to its destination
; and to T at once  the second bringing T back; A lane is eight cells and every
; byte of it travels the same distance  so each run is one repeated token  the
; way sha512/hashcore writes its long runs; Every distance below was worked out
; from the map above and written down;

  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; read the state little endian  leaving the pointer
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; past it
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; continued
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; continued
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; continued
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; continued
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>         ; continued
