; ============================================================ ; every lane takes its own column's contribution
                                                               ; A lane is finished once it has been read  so it is
                                                               ; MOVED to the frame rather than copied; D is not
                                                               ; finished  because five lanes of the row above and
                                                               ; below it want the same one  so D is copied through T
                                                               ; every time

